### Robots.txt
GET http://localhost:8080/robots.txt


### Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics


### Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz


### Mobile config
GET http://localhost:8080/.mobileconfig


### Reload blocklist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/reload
X-API-Key: test_123456
User-Agent: test-client

{"name": "dot-block"}


### Check blocklist (JSON)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/check
X-API-Key: test_123456
Content-Type: application/json

["google.com", "www.ex.co", "ads.net"]


### Check blocklist (Plain text)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/check
X-API-Key: test_123456
Content-Type: text/plain

google.com
www.ex.co
ads.net
track.wargaming-aff.com


### Disable blocklist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/disable
X-API-Key: test_123456
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "dot-block", "duration": "PT5M"}


### Re-enable blocklist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/reenable
X-API-Key: test_123456
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "dot-block"}


### Blocklist status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/status
X-API-Key: test_123456
Accept: application/json


### Get Custom Blocklist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/custom
X-API-Key: test_123456
Accept: application/json


### Add Custom Domains
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/custom
X-API-Key: test_123456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domains": [
    "bad-tracker.example.com",
    "ads.example.org"
  ]
}


### Remove Custom Domains
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/blocklist/custom
X-API-Key: test_123456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domains": [
    "ads.example.org"
  ]
}


### ASN Lookup
GET http://localhost:8080/api/asn/24.123.12.0
X-API-Key: test_123456
Accept: application/json


### DoH POST
POST http://localhost:8080/dns-query
Content-Type: application/dns-message
Accept: application/dns-message

< ./docs/query.bin


### DoH GET
GET http://localhost:8080/dns-query?dns=AAABAAABAAAAAAAAA3d3dwdleGFtcGxlA2NvbQAAAQAB
Accept: application/dns-message


### DoH GET (DNS JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/dns-query?name=html-load.com&type=A
Accept: application/dns-json


### DoH CORS preflight
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/dns-query
Origin: https://my-domain.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Accept


### DoH GET (DNS JSON) with CORS
GET http://localhost:8080/dns-query?name=example.com&type=A
Accept: application/dns-json
Origin: https://my-domain.com


### DoH GET (DNS JSON) - Punycode IDN Domain
GET http://localhost:8080/dns-query?name=xn--exmple-cua.com&type=A
Accept: application/dns-json


### DoH GET (DNS JSON) - Unicode Domain
GET http://localhost:8080/dns-query?name=ex%C3%A4mple.com&type=A
Accept: application/dns-json


### Admin UI
GET http://localhost:8080/
Accept: text/html


### Who Am I
GET http://admin.localhost:8080/whoami
Accept: application/json


### Version Info
GET http://localhost:8080/api/version-info
X-API-Key: test_123456
Accept: application/json


### Banned IPs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/banned-ips
X-API-Key: test_123456
Accept: application/json


### CORS preflight
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/banned-ips
Origin: http://example.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type


### DNS Events Stream (SSE)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events
X-API-Key: test_123456
Accept: text/event-stream


### JSON Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/metrics
X-API-Key: test_123456
Accept: application/json

